Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.85,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:04.52,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.19,0:00:06.48,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.15,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:13.99,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:17.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,K-Kotomi…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.66,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Hello, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't “hello” me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.29,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.29,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:29.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,God… And I was having a nice nap…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:32.21,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So I played a lullaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:34.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was about to fall into an eternal sleep from the shock! {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:36.51,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Okazaki! Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:38.30,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:45.44,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Hello. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:48.69,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My name is Ichinose Kotomi. A senior in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:50.32,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My hobby is reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And her weapon is the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:55.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It emits lethal sound waves only 0.2 seconds after she takes position.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The number of people she's felled is countless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:04.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I've never felled people with the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.83,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,M-My eardrums…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:08.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you see us on the floor right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey! Kotomi! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.55,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:15.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So that was Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:18.72,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Kyou-chan, Ryou-chan, Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:20.68,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Hello to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:22.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't “hello” me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.14,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Bonjour?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:26.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:32.07,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Bo-n-jour?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:35.69,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Why can't I communicate with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:38.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please calm down for now, Kyou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:41.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's right. You lose if you get trapped in her pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:48.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.71,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Playing the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.25,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's the one that was in the music room, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:57.34,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,They lent it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:01.64,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,They said, “If you like it that much,\Nwould you like to use it for a while?”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:03.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:04.52,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Allow me to play the next piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:05.97,Default,All,0,0,0,,You don't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:16.94,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}{\kf46}su{\kf22}ki {\kf46}to{\kf46}o{\kf160}ru {\kf17}yu{\kf43}me {\kf17}wo {\kf40}mi{\kf29}te{\kf23}i{\kf53}ta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:16.94,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}I was watching a crystal clear dream,
