Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:23.39,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}I'll be sure to pass them to you, in the distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:35.81,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}{\kf48}no{\kf42}ko{\kf29}sa{\kf210}zu {\kf52}tsu{\kf49}ta{\kf22}e{\kf183}te {\kf64}ki{\kf491}tto
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:35.81,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\be1}without leaving anything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.08,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.58,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It wasn't funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:55.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't make such a sad face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:04:00.05,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,See, your gags don't have any momentum, and you say them with the wrong timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's fatal for a comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:06.14,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you understand, go to that corner and take practice swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:10.89,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What were you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:11.89,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:13.73,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:17.48,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you don't keep her occupied,\Nshe'll start playing the violin again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.35,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.94,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:18.98,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:22.99,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Ryou-ch—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:25.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're all here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:28.78,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Nagisa-ch—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:32.04,Default-alt,Kyo,0,0,0,,See? You don't have the timing down, so you can't say it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Give it another try, Kotomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.17,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:39.75,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.51,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Kyou-chan, was that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Let's just say it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:52.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:52.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}The After School Rhapsody
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.52,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I see lots of unique things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:59.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've opened it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:03.24,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Is the recruiting of new members making any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:08.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Not yet, but I want to get enough members by the time the School Festival comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:12.45,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:14.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think it's a magic wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:17.46,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Magic wand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:23.88,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You say an incantation as you twirl it in the air,\Nand then you transform with flying stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:41.06,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: This incantation is from the fictional grimoire, {\i1}De Vermis Mysteriis{\i0}, part of the Lovecraft Mythos
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:32.26,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tibi, magnum Innominandum,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:32.26,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,To you, the great Not-To-Be-Named,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:36.10,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Signa stellarum nigrarum
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:36.10,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,signs of the black stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:41.06,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Et bufaniformis Sadoquae sigillum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:41.06,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,and the seal of the toad-shaped Tsathoggua.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.45,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Looks like nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:50.87,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Maybe I didn't enunciate it correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But you're amazing, Kotomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:58.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to be able to recite lines smoothly like you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:01.67,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,They're all getting along well, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:03.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You should go join the conversation, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:07.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You want me to hold that wand and recite strange incantations?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Can you even see me doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.47,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.81,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Piraruku Piraruku Gyo Gyo Gyo Gyo Gyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.10,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I love fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:24.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Can I punch you until you cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:34.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The conversation drifted towards saying she's better with the violin than incantations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you have to play it, play it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If the reputation of the drama club is tarnished, you'll cause the president trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:46.38,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I want a lot of people to hear it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:54.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's probably a good thing you feel that way,\Nseeing how you used to hide in the library, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:07:01.27,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Plus, I have to return this violin to the music room eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:04.90,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So I want to play it as much as possible while I have the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.78,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Let's do something about it, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.44,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Let's see… {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:11.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Okay. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:15.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow, on Monday, we'll hold your violin recital. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.41,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Recital?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:20.96,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We'll gather more people for you on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.67,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So you're prohibited from playing the violin here until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.75,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Recital…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.17,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll go practice then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,May I accompany you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.68,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:41.06,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'll work out the details for the recital with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.48,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Okay, then we'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.57,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,See you later, Tomoya-kun, Kyou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Work out what details?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was just splitting you and Kotomi up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:57.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,She's always all over you, head-to-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:08:00.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So I thought it would be better for her to spend time with other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.54,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Therefore, {ep10}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:06.88,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,we've been left alone. {ep10}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.21,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What should we do? {ep10}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:09.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm tired, so I'm going to sleep. {ep10}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:12.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You're super rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:15.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please don't screw around with me while I'm sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You think it was all right to leave them alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:28.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You really do have a tendency to spoil children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.15,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Both Ryou and the President are there, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:34.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm worried because it's those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.91,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, you said you don't have\Na girl you're dating now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:44.16,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If there was a girl out there who loved you so much that she couldn't control herself…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.21,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,…would you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,…date her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Just answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:53.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if I did, I'm a delinquent bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The girl would probably get tired of me soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Delinquents can be well-liked in some cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Especially by girls with good grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then Sunohara is well-liked, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's totally impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Thanks for your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.03,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.29,Default-alt,TV,0,0,0,,How are you all spending this Sunday morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:28.83,Default-alt,TV,0,0,0,,Today is a beautiful morning throughout the nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.80,Default-alt,TV,0,0,0,,and various events are being held at different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't think Nagisa is up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess I'll bother Sunohara again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:45.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:48.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:53.28,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are you here? It's Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:59.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you a ghost living on campus or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.12,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm here as your host.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.12,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't even go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:06.12,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, are you a bully?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:09.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I instinctively stopped you since it was so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:16.84,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It was a very advanced joke which puns ghost, a hypothetical creature, {Dei- combine for 16.9}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:23.51,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,and host, the noun form of “to host”, the act of catering to a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It wasn't advanced at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.39,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Maybe in the B range?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:33.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Frankly, it was at an {\i1}absolutely{\i0\fscx60} {\r} low level.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:35.11,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,You really are a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Honorary library attendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:44.28,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was borrowing the key day after day,\Nand then the librarian gave it to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:46.95,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,…and made me an honorary library attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's why you're here even on a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:55.42,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm usually reading books,\Nbut today, I'm practicing the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:11:00.30,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was told not to use the drama club's room, so I was practicing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's your bento for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:08.89,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was thinking that maybe you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:10.56,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,So I made enough for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What would you have done if I hadn't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.81,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:16.94,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,But you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:20.40,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's an apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:25.12,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's my first time making it,\Nso I don't know if turned out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It looks professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:34.38,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I used sour apple and coated it with an apricot jam smoothed with rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.29,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,This tea, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:39.34,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I used actual tea leaves for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:42.13,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Itadakimashou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:49.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is this really your first time making this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.56,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Um… It wasn't good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:57.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't believe that this is your first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I could eat this nonstop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you unfreeze when I hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you a household appliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.87,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Um, is it really good?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Really for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:14.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.17,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:19.59,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm really, really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.60,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:37.65,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Day before yesterday I saw a rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.19,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,and yesterday a deer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:42.49,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,and today, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:45.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:51.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,More violin practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:55.58,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Since I'm full, time for a little rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.25,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,You know, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.59,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Only if you don't mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:04.84,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Can we…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:06.68,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Can we…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:07.68,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,…with one another…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.39,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,…read a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:18.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, books aren't very entertaining to read together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.90,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,You don't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:24.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then could you read one to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.45,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:28.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I like watching you read books,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:31.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and I like your voice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:34.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, but no difficult science books.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:36.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Make it a novel or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:37.67,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:46.84,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,In order to get accepted into a comedian training school, I'm practicing the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:50.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think that plot is too whacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.68,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It's a violin standup comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:54.85,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:58.31,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,When the dango flower blooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.94,Default-alt,Kot,0,0,0,,What the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.31,0:14:00.06,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:00.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Dango?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:04.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm cooking bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:08.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tonight, the dango will be making love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:13.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Oh no, the dango are…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:19.50,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,The reading says that you have schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How can you tell that from fortune telling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.42,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:28.09,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,The way you see things is proof of schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:29.30,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You can't, Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.89,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,He's my patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:34.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew it was about time for you to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.85,0:14:40.14,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,The gas emitted from cooking bread is unhealthy for human physiology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:41.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:45.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Again, that must be due to the gas emitted from the baking of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.82,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.53,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:54.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, you sounded like you were having a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:56.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was having a strange dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.58,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,A scary dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:01.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rather, it was a dream that didn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:06.63,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.43,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,You know, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:17.97,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I was really happy that you came today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:21.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was sleeping practically the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:24.31,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Even so. I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:26.44,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:31.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ichinose Kotomi, Violin Recital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:33.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The one who made this poster is…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:38.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Kyou-chan asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:44.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Honestly, I questioned the Big Dango Family, but it has a good impact, so I said okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:47.25,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm sure lots of guests will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:50.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But will it really be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:54.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have a history of putting up\Nrecruitment posters and getting yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:58.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll let them know about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:02.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You should pick up some of her shamelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:06.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you're too considerate of those around you,\Nyou won't reestablish the drama club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:12.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Now we go invite everyone we know before the end of the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:16.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:19.45,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,You gave me an invitation, so of course I'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:23.75,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,It's my first violin recital, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:27.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I know it's strange to tell you this, being the one who invited you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:31.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but try to get a seat towards the back and be ready to run at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.42,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:35.47,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What did {\i1}you{\i0\fscx24.75} {\r} do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.30,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I just skipped cleaning duty the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:40.81,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah, I only forgot to bring\Nthe lifestyle guidance handout back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:42.64,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Why does that have to get us into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:45.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I was threatened for eating lunch early half a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:50.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's Kyou. She collected all the criminals for their misdemeanors using her class rep status.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:51.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:52.94,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's with this crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:54.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Is something happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You came without knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Kyou asked me to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She said a real cute chick wants to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:03.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Man, it's tough being a playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see. Godspeed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.04,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When I get to know her well, I'll introduce her to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:10.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:14.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll let him dream for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:16.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're here, too, Misae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.55,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,The bunch from the rugby club invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:22.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I had some time, so I wanted to hear what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.18,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:29.94,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Would you be Sagara Misae-san,\Nthe dorm parent of the boys' dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:30.98,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:33.78,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I'm Sakagami Tomoyo. A junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:36.28,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with the rumors about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:40.99,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You were a legendary student council president, and you're now working as a dorm parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Student council president?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.83,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.96,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It was nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:48.75,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:51.46,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to become\Nthe student council president, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:54.26,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,May I visit you to ask for advice in the near future?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.97,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I can't give you much in the way of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.14,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,If you're okay with that, come anytime you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.43,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Misae-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.06,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We've reserved the seat for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:03.06,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:07.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Misae-san was a student council president, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.81,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:11.15,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me to this recital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:12.11,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:13.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:14.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:15.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you came…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I invited them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:22.87,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We can't stay away after being invited by our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:27.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,We couldn't come for the Founders Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:28.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,so we wanted to make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Isn't Kotomi's violin… {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:35.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. She's improved a lot. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There's Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:40.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,She's a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:42.30,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Not as cute as our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:47.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,All right, thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:50.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Look, she made me buy these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.15,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Me too. For ¥300.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou was even making money off of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.99,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So you know, the earplugs are your last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:19:01.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,There will be penalties waiting for the spineless wimps who use them early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.74,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan, your introduction to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:05.91,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:10.87,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My name is Ichinose Kotomi. A senior in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.38,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,My hobby is reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.34,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.71,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Well said. Everyone, a round of applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What's with that lame clapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Give me more noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:24.51,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She's a pretty good MC.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:28.77,Default,San,0,0,0,,I feel like I've met them somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They're Kyou-chan and Ryou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We became friends the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:34.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bring them over one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We'll give them a warm welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:37.57,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:40.32,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Here's the first piece of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:51.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How do you call this an improvement?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She was doing better during practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:56.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think… I think she's nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:02.38,Default-alt,Tom,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing,\Ntaking advantage of the situation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.51,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:10.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Botan! You came again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.85,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What is this violin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.44,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.24,Default,Cat,0,0,0,,Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:21.86,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:28.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,I don't think I can last any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.71,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae… Hang in there, Sanae.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:38.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:46.05,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Looks like everything made it through in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:48.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Although we had fatalities in the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:53.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You played the last song really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.39,0:20:55.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,My dad said it was good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:59.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,He said he hasn't seen a breathtaking stage performance like this in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:02.78,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I'm so glad. I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:07.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why are we all working so hard for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:12.37,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She has this little kid side to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:16.83,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's like, we can't leave her alone,\Nand it's tickling our maternal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:18.63,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:23.34,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I feel that I want to do anything if it's for Kotomi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:26.05,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You're so merry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:28.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She's your rival, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:30.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.60,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Nothing! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:35.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:36.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:37.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.15,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:42.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.11,0:21:46.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you have something you need to say, I'll hear it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.11,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Ah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:51.53,Default,Man,0,0,0,,I'll come back another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:54.33,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:58.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.58,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,He's…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:01.54,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,…a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.55,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,He's a bad person.
