Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.81,0:23:43.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad2.5\pos(960,470)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:43.06,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:49.03,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,If I hadn't met you, I don't think I would have had so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:51.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:55.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, Kyou, and Fujibayashi just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:56.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:59.95,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,If that's true, I'll be really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:03.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kotomi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:09.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad2.5\pos(960,410)}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:09.67,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs85\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad2.5\pos(960,760)}Hidden World
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:07.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kotomi-chan?
